    "answer": "You can click \"Open Account Now\" and follow the online instructions to complete identity verification and information submission. The account opening process usually takes 5-10 minutes. Once the account is approved, you can deposit funds and trade. We need to verify your identity document and proof of address to meet KYC requirements."
