    "question": "What deposit methods are supported?",
    "answer": "We support bank transfer (FPS, wire transfer), cheque deposit and other methods. All deposits must come from a bank account in the client's own name to ensure source-of-funds compliance. Deposits usually arrive within 1-2 business days."
